[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2040.35, "timestamp": "00:34:00", "text": "おめでとう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2044.149, "timestamp": "00:34:04", "text": "おめでとうございます。楽しんでください。楽しんでいただければ幸いです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2047.389, "timestamp": "00:34:07", "text": "バットマンとかそういうやつ。幸運を。良い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2050.43, "timestamp": "00:34:10", "text": "運。待って、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2054.349, "timestamp": "00:34:14", "text": "6月？えっと、6月じゃないですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2057.27, "timestamp": "00:34:17", "text": "あなたは忙しくないですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2059.389, "timestamp": "00:34:19", "text": "と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2061.75, "timestamp": "00:34:21", "text": "もの？無料の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2064.31, "timestamp": "00:34:24", "text": "日付？私の、えーと、自由なデート相手と比較してみます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2065.79, "timestamp": "00:34:25", "text": "わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2068.869, "timestamp": "00:34:28", "text": "待って。自由行動日。とりあえず見せるしかないかな。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2069.31, "timestamp": "00:34:29", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "holidays"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2073.109, "timestamp": "00:34:33", "text": "こんにちは。こんにちは、アダスさん。ようこそ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2074.51, "timestamp": "00:34:34", "text": "無料のデートプラン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2077.27, "timestamp": "00:34:37", "text": "ええと、書き直しです。えっと、今日ですよね？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2077.358, "timestamp": "00:34:37", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "vacations started"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2080.389, "timestamp": "00:34:40", "text": "これは今日のことです。だから私はこれを持っていない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2083.71, "timestamp": "00:34:43", "text": "まだ確認されていません。 JCanに連絡する必要があります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2088.47, "timestamp": "00:34:48", "text": "JCはジャンとクインによる作品です。私は引きずっています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2091.51, "timestamp": "00:34:51", "text": "毎日彼らに。それらを入れています"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2091.631, "timestamp": "00:34:51", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "today is tuesday?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2094.069, "timestamp": "00:34:54", "text": "都合が悪くなったので日程を変更しました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2097.03, "timestamp": "00:34:57", "text": "なぜなら、私の体はいくつかの点で機能していないからです"}]